# Git Branches

Fetch `origin/main` before creating a feature branch. Start the branch from
that exact ref, never from stale local `main`, another feature branch, or an old
commit.

```bash
git fetch origin main --tags
git switch -c <branch> origin/main
```

Cursor and Codex hooks call `script/branch_off_main_policy.py` to enforce this.
